checks none nothing changed
checks docs tsc (npm run typecheck)
checks ui tsc + npx vitest related <files> --run; screenshots at 400, 768, 1366, 1920, 2560
checks content tsc + npx vitest related <files> --run; npm test once at the end
checks logic npx vitest related <files> --run while iterating; npm run test:changed or npm test once at the end; Moodle side: mci auto
checks schema mci auto in moodle/local/mooblox (full PHPUnit, savepoints, privacy) + npm test
checks engine npm test + perf gate: flock /tmp/mooblox-perf.lock timeout 900 npm run test:perf
checks security mci full in moodle/local/mooblox + npm test
checks full npm run test:all + mci full (class unknown)
